-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/11/a-decision-taken-in-a-carpark-that-a-vital-medical-service-be-denied/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">一个在停车场做出的决定，一项重要的医疗服务因此被拒绝</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A decision taken in a carpark that a vital medical service be denied</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项关键医疗服务仅因在非正式场合（停车场）做出的决定而被取消，这引发了对医疗决策过程透明度和合理性的质疑，并可能对患者造成严重影响。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/11/us-forces-disable-ship-attempting-to-run-iran-blockade-in-gulf-of-oman?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美军在阿曼湾阻止一艘船只“试图冲破”伊朗封锁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US forces disable ship ‘attempting to run’ Iran blockade in Gulf of Oman</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国军方报告称，在阿曼湾成功阻止了一艘试图冲破伊朗海上封锁的船只，此事件凸显了该区域地缘政治的紧张局势，以及美伊双方的持续对峙。（西方主流）</span><span