dp9wo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴拿马发生7.7级强震，建筑物受损</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Powerful magnitude 7.7 earthquake hits Panama, damaging buildings</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴拿马发生里氏7.7级强烈地震，造成建筑物受损，地震强度大，可能对当地基础设施和民众生活造成严重影响，引起国际社会关注。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
